            "content": "do you find you can enjoy anything at the moment?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "No. I used to love reading, but now it just feels like work."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "right, thanks. sounds like a lot is going on for you Sarah."
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "It feels like my whole life has been turned upside down."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "I'm wondering how you feel within yourself. you know, when you have a moment to yourself and check in with Sarah... how does she feel?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Honestly? I don't know. I haven't really looked."
