        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Okay... I'll try."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "I'm just thinking that when people are feeling flat, it's not unusual for them to feel a bit... I guess... emotional?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah. I guess I'm just scared of what I might find."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "do you ever catch yourself wanting to cry?"
